</div>
</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Goldin’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$272k</strong>, taken from the <strong>$679k</strong> he is contracted to earn this season. Nothing he was paid last year was published.</p>
<p>He is Russian and played at Texas Tech and Florida Atlantic before a final college season at Michigan. He went undrafted in 2025 at 24.</p>

