<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/vladislav-goldin/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/vladislav-goldin/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Vladislav Goldin’s Salary in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Goldin earns $679k in 2026-27 on a two-way contract, level with Johnson and Donaldson at the bottom of the Miami salary list. His first season published no figure, so this is the whole of his published career earnings. The salary is not counted in the club’s $206.62m payroll and sits outside the salary cap."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Vladislav Goldin Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The contract covers this season only and just $91k of it is protected. Miami can convert it to a standard deal at any point, and can end it at almost no cost."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Vladislav Goldin Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $679k season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Vladislav Goldin’s Contract at Miami?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Goldin signed a two-way contract with Miami in 2026 covering this season, of which $91k is protected. It is the second two-way contract Miami has given him. Every two-way contract in the league pays the same figure, so there was nothing in it to negotiate."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Vladislav Goldin’s Estimated Net Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Goldin’s net worth is estimated at around $272k, taken from the $679k he is contracted to earn this season. Nothing he was paid last year was published. He is Russian and played at Texas Tech and Florida Atlantic before a final college season at Michigan. He went undrafted in 2025 at 24."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Do the Heat Have Vladislav Goldin on a Two-Way Deal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Goldin is paid $679k because the collective agreement fixes what a two-way contract pays, and a second one at the same club pays exactly what the first did. He arrived in the league at 24 after five college seasons at three schools."}}]}</script>
